                                                                     "broadcast":  15,
                                                                     "arange":  10,
                                                                     "copy":  3,
                                                                     "_canonical_source":  "Isolated 910B3 CCE microbenchmarks in perfbound/calibration/bench_output/vector_peak_transcendental_{exp,log,sqrt,rsqrt}{,_fp32}.csv; generic values are rounded FP16 cycles per 128 elements and dtype-specific FP32 values are below. Other opcodes remain from calib_910b3_v4_opcode.json.",
                                                                     "_measured_raw":  {
